                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "stat system not good.....bad balancing between choices....\nI played as a caring kind master and the lasts few choices overthrew all my previous ones and suddenly I was super pragmatic evil master. \nStats between monsters are relative, means if you have monster affinity A:91 B:91 C:92 D:90, it will be described you are doing favoritism for C. Also D will hate you because they are the lowest even though the difference btw C and D is just 2. There will be huge difference btw how C and D react to you. Which doesnt make any sense!\nStory wise.....a bit short but not bad. Its just that I wont do another run anytime soon.",
